{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Looking for a Job"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Results of Persistence"}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 3}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Discuss factual and abstract information about common everyday or job related topics in both work and social contexts appropriate for the interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le03ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Time Clauses"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use <span class=\"italic\">time clauses</span> to be precise about when an event or action occurred or will occur."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Remember, a <span class=\"italic\">clause</span> has its own subject and verb. They can come at the beginning of a sentence (separated by a comma) or at the end of a sentence.  </br></br> Look at the chart as a reference for different words or phrases used in time clauses and their meanings or uses."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Word/Phrase\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning/Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ever since\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"when things started\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I've been waiting for this moment ever since I met Mr. Brody.  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"while, as, whilst, when\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"things happening at the same time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Ms. Martha Sellers, my executive assistant, will be responsible for your onboarding while you are under the probationary period. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"as soon as, before, after, once\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"one thing following another\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Please sign the enclosed copy of this letter and return it as soon as possible to indicate your acceptance of this offer.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Simple Present, Present Continuous and Present Perfect Tenses"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " In any conversation or work-related text, you may see a variety of tenses being used. Understanding the slight differences between each tense is key to being a fully functional and confident employee or business associate."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The following chart summarizes some common tenses."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning/Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"express habits/truths</br></br>scheduled event/plan\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject + verb + object\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Employee benefits include the following items as part of our group insurance plan. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"action in progress at the time of speaking </br></br> planned action in the future</br></br>habitual action\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject + <span class=\\\"italic\\\">am</span>/<span class=\\\"italic\\\">is</span>/<span class=\\\"italic\\\">are</span> + v-<span class=\\\"italic\\\">ing</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The position we are offering is that of editorial assistant at a salary of $50,000 per year. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"past action at an unspecified  time </br></br> action that started in the past and is continuing now\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject + <span class=\\\"italic\\\">has</span>/<span class=\\\"italic\\\">have</span> + past participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We are pleased to confirm that you have been selected for employment at BFP.  \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "employment"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "job; position"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I look forward to talking to you further about employment opportunities."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to make a job offer."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "valuable contributions"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something that is done or given that helps the team or company a lot"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My diverse skills enable me to make a valuable contribution to your company. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "high standards"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " expectations for quality work"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This has inspired me to maintain high standards for content. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "executive assistant"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " the person who helps the company president or CEO in a variety of ways, such as scheduling appointments."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You are a good executive assistant, Denise."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "creativity"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the ability to come up with original ideas"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I also saw evidence of creativity and problem-solving skills. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "problem-solving"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " the ability to find solutions to problems"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The Boss also saw evidence of creativity and problem-solving skills. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob11aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "innovation"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " change leading to an improved way of doing things"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They say that innovation is the key to success today. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob11aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I discuss a job offer."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I give my opinion about a job offer."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write suggestions for improvement."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Read Adam's job offer in this lesson again."}, {"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, discuss what is good about this job."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discuss what may not be good, or what may be a cause for concern."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discuss how the letter could be improved."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Suggest 5 improvement to make it a better job or a better letter."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write the suggestions."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le03ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le03ob11re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le03ob11re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Adam</span>: Hey Kristi! Guess what!  I just got a letter from BFP!\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Kristi</span>: Open it!  That letter needs to be opened right away!\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Adam</span>: I've been waiting for this moment ever since I met Mr. Brody.\n</br></br>February 23rd\n</br>Dear Mr. Bari,\n</br>Congratulations! We are pleased to confirm that you have been selected for employment at BFP.\nThe position we are offering is that of editorial assistant at a salary of $50,000 per year. This is a permanent position. You will report to the Director of Online Content, Mr. Peter Sanders. Your working hours will normally be from 8:30 a.m. - 5:00 p.m., but this schedule may need some adjusting.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le03ob11re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "You will be under a period of probation for three months from the beginning of your employment.\n</br>Employee benefits include the following items as part of our group insurance plan. Some forms need to be completed before your coverage can begin.</ul>\n<li>   Long-term Disability\n</li> <li>   Dental Care\n</li> <li>       Short-term Health care\n</li> <li>       A bank of 5 sick days per year\n</li><li>      Three weeks holiday per year\n</li></ul>", "id": 2, "time": "38000", "image": "engenn10le03ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "We would like you to start work on Monday February 27th. If this date is not acceptable to you, please contact me immediately as we need to be informed to make alternative arrangements. Ms. Martha Sellers, my executive assistant, will be responsible for your onboarding while you are under the probationary period.\n</br>Please sign the enclosed copy of this letter and return it as soon as possible to indicate your acceptance of this offer. We are confident that through your creativity and problem-solving skills, you will be able to make a valuable contribution to the success of our BFP. We expect you will help us to maintain high standards as we strive for innovation in journalism. We look forward to working with you.\n</br>Sincerely, </br>\nBoris Brody</br>\nPublisher, BFP", "id": 3, "time": "60200", "image": "engenn10le03ob11re2img03.jpg"}]}}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about my experiences "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can exchange opinions about  my academic studies and my work in various time frames. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can express necessity and duty about a work-related process.  "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about jobs, professions and careers."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " From your experience, how do employers inform candidates when they get a job?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What is the best way to find out? Why?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What are some bad ways to find out? Why?"}]}, {"type": "group", "conte